      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this CL, we introduced a speed feature `disable_ref_frame_mvs` for low-complexity decode mode. This speed feature is enabled specifically for the `shorts608p` resolution.\n\nPerformance results of encoder and decoder for the streams generated\nwith low complexity decode enabled.\n```\n                       Instruction Count                                                                 \n                          Reduction(%)                   BD-Rate Loss(%)                    Time Reduction(%)\ncpu-used  Resolution    Encoder   Decoder    avg.psnr  ovr.psnr  ssim    vmaf    vmaf_neg    dav1d Decoder   \n   1          608P       3.665     10.871     0.4256    0.4049   0.5681  0.7417  0.6441       11.048\n   2          608P       4.911     10.793     0.4236    0.4415   0.5679  0.8037  0.7359       11.299\n   3          608P       3.660     10.630     0.7028    0.7347   0.8917  0.9000  0.8598       11.221\n```\nThe instruction count reduction specified has been measured using command:\n`$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./aomenc …`\n`$ perf stat -e instructions:u ./dav1d --cpumask avx2 …`\nThe decode time is measured using command\n`time taskset -c 0  ./dav1d  --cpumask avx2 …`\n\nWe have verified that this CL produces no noticeable artifacts for the max-drop contents.",
      "revId": "80c5a4adcbaed7d318733752d8445b997e9de68f",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
