      "side": 1,
      "message": "This speed feature shows better performance for the `shorts608p` resolution compared to other resolutions. Below are the performance results when the sf is enabled for other resolutions.\n```\n                       Instruction Count                                 \n                          Reduction(%)                   BD-Rate Loss(%)            \ncpu-used  Resolution    Encoder   Decoder  avg.psnr   ovr.psnr   ssim    vmaf    vmaf_neg\n   3      LOWRES2       5.044      8.587    1.6527     1.7068   1.9258   2.2033    2.1287\n   3      MIDRES2       4.416      9.711    1.5749     1.6179   1.6299   2.0478    1.9868\n   3       HDRES2       5.088     16.369    1.9646     2.0628   2.0314   2.2991    2.3179  \n\n```",
      "parentUuid": "4c0f8bf7_9b1af632",
